### fan-out-documents — FanOutTask (TaskType 21, inline) elle deneme
### Otomatik senaryo: tests/Core.IntegrationTests/Tests/FanOut, api-tests/fan-out-documents/fanout-load.py
### MockLab ayakta olmali (http://localhost:3001) — seed: etc/docker/config/seed/fan-out-documents-collection.json

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = fan-out-documents
@instanceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Start instance — 5 dokuman, hepsi basarili
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "testId": "fanout-manual-happy",
  "documents": [
    { "id": "DOC-1", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-1.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-2", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-2.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-3", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-3.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-4", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-4.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-5", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-5.pdf" }
  ]
}

### Start instance — 5 dokuman, 2'si MockLab'de deterministik olarak patlar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "testId": "fanout-manual-partial",
  "documents": [
    { "id": "DOC-1", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-1.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-FAIL-A", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-fail-a.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-3", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-3.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-FAIL-B", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-fail-b.pdf" },
    { "id": "DOC-5", "url": "https://example.invalid/doc-5.pdf" }
  ]
}

### Fan out — batch'i calistirir (onEntry: fan-out task + version stamp)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/process-documents?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{}

### Instance data — documentResults / documentResultsSummary / versionSeenByFanOut / versionAfterFanOut
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### State — documents-completed veya documents-partial-failure bekleniyor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/state
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### TEK-YAZIM sondasi — bu versiyon VAR olmali (fan-out'un yazdigi surum)
### versionSeenByFanOut = 1.0.1 ise burasi 1.0.2 olmali; data null DONMEMELI.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/data?version=1.0.2
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### TEK-YAZIM sondasi — bu versiyon OLMAMALI (5 item ayri ayri yazsaydi olurdu)
### 200 doner ama govdedeki "data" null olmali. Orchestration bu uçta 404 vermez.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/data?version=1.0.5
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Item journal (SADECE monitoring host'ta — 4203, dev/light compose stack)
### `{fanOutTaskKey}#{index}` anahtarli satirlar burada gorunur: fan-out-documents-task#0 ...
GET http://localhost:4203/api/v1/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/tasks
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Cancel
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/cancel-fan-out-documents?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{}
